sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant BR as Broker
  participant W4 as Worker S4
  participant DB as DB S4
  participant EP as E-mail Provider
  participant API as API Notificações
  actor U as Usuário

  BR->>W4: evento application.created
  W4->>DB: INSERT notification (status=queued)
  W4->>W4: render template
  W4->>EP: send email
  alt sucesso
    EP-->>W4: 200 OK
    W4->>DB: UPDATE notification (status=sent, delivered_at)
  else falha recuperável
    EP-->>W4: 5xx/timeout
    W4->>DB: UPDATE attempt (failed, reason), status=queued/ retry
    W4->>BR: reenfileirar/retry (backoff)
  else falha final
    W4->>DB: status=dead_lettered
    W4->>BR: mover para DLQ / registro DLQ
  end
  U->>API: GET /v1/notifications
  API->>DB: SELECT notifications WHERE user_id
  API-->>U: 200 {items}